.TH sam-jail-hints 1 2026-11-16 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-hints \- Things to check right after creating a sandbox, with one\-click fixes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail hints\fR [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Things to check right after creating a sandbox, with one\-click fixes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR \fI<APPLY>\fR
Apply the hint with this id
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Also apply a hint rated Think twice or Dangerous, or one that turns on compatibility mode; without it such a hint is refused
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

